  "name": "Tainted Love",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "After months of buildup, the annual AVENGERS/THUNDERBOLTS crossover explodes! Only a stroke of luck allowed the Avengers to defeat him in the past! Now, a fully-powered Count Nefaria has returned! The key to taking him down is locked in the mind of Madame Masque, but can Iron Man convince her to help the team against her own father? We'll all find out as the story barrels into next month's THUNDERBOLTS #44!"
    }
